keywords:
  - chordoma
  - TBXT
  - public data reanalysis
  - gene-set scoring
  - evidence layers
  - reproducible-research
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code for a layered cross-cohort reanalysis of public
  chordoma transcriptomic and proteomic datasets. Discovery, functional
  perturbation, developmental context, held-out validation, and confirmatory
  layers are kept explicitly separate, and integration is performed only at the
  level of prespecified signature and pathway scores. Outputs are
  hypothesis-prioritization maps, not clinical classifiers.
